findings.body:
The fix adds `print(f"Starting execution for node: {downstream_node_id}")` in `propagate_skip_from_edge`. This runs on every taken-edge skip propagation, writes to stdout, and bypasses the project's logging setup. It also has no place in the graph engine, which uses structured logging elsewhere. Remove it. If the trace is needed while debugging, use the module's logger at debug level.

